{
  "info": {
    "name": "Mindy Phase 4.4 - Session Operations, Makeup and Attendance Reports",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": "4.4a Session operations, 4.4b placements/guest and 4.4c timetable/history/reports are implemented locally. Requires compiled migrations through1792022400001 and all attendance prerequisites. Leave approval/approved intervals remain a separate source gap. Use the existing login cookie jar; switch ACTIVE ADMIN/MANAGER, STUDENT and assigned target MENTOR cookies explicitly. Mutations require current versions and a UUIDv4 Idempotency-Key: retry identical intent with the same key/body; use a new key for new intent. Do not run the entire mutation collection blindly. 4.4c reads never mutate; Student history/summary are own metadata only, including terminal enrollments. Schedule requires paired from/to<=31 days; report optional paired ranges<=93 days, omitted report range is full history/backlog. Guest context is session-only, no receiving Class/material/CASH entitlement. Source credit counts once, nullable rate means no finalized eligible obligations. No deployment or live payment evidence is implied."
  },
